{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfcfb; --accent:#6a9b6a; --muted:#62707a; --card:#ffffff; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --accent-2:#7aa3b5; --accent-3:#d6f0d6;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f6faf6);color:#0f1720;line-height:1.4}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.35));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.04);z-index:30}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    nav a.logo{font-weight:800;color:#133;letter-spacing:0.6px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;padding:48px 0}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(10,20,15,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px;color:#072}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted)}
    .pattern{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.06}
    /* inline SVG background styled */
    .mood-buttons{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood-buttons button{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,15,0.06);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffb);cursor:pointer}
    .mood-buttons button.active{outline:3px solid rgba(106,155,106,0.14);transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .recommend{margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent-3),#ffffff);border:1px solid rgba(106,155,106,0.08)}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    form.contact-form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,15,0.06);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    /* timeline */
    .timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .phase{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbfe);border:1px solid rgba(10,20,15,0.04)}
    .phase .num{min-width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--accent-3);font-weight:800;color:#062}
    .phase h4{margin:0;font-size:15px}
    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#6b6b6b;margin-top:8px}
    footer{padding:24px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wrap{padding:18px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="pattern" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <!-- Unique organic cellular pattern (inline, intentionally one-off) -->
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#e8f7e8" />
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f2fbf2" />
      </linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p1" width="120" height="120" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <rect width="120" height="120" fill="url(#g1)" />
        <g fill-opacity="0.25" fill="#9ac79a">
          <circle cx="18" cy="22" r="20" />
          <circle cx="90" cy="70" r="26" />
          <ellipse cx="58" cy="50" rx="36" ry="20" />
        </g>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" />
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html" class="logo">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="about.html">Team</a>
        <a href="book.html">Sessions</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent);font-weight:800">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>How are you feeling today?</h1>
          <p class="lead">Pick the closest state and we’ll suggest a short, practical way to move forward. The recommendation updates the short consult link below.</p>

          <div class="mood-buttons" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood selector">
            <button data-mood="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button data-mood="drained">Drained</button>
            <button data-mood="restless">Restless</button>
            <button data-mood="stuck">Stuck</button>
            <button data-mood="curious">Curious</button>
          </div>

          <div id="recommend" class="recommend" aria-live="polite">
            <strong id="rec-title">Choose a state above</strong>
            <div id="rec-desc" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">We’ll describe a short first step, and a suggested session length.</div>
            <a id="primary-cta" class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:14px" class="meta">Prefer a call? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h4>Planner: three-phase pathway</h4>
          <p class="meta">Choose an intended start week to estimate pacing. This is educational guidance, not medical advice.</p>

          <label class="meta" for="startWeeks" style="display:block;margin-top:8px">Start in (weeks):</label>
          <select id="startWeeks" style="max-width:120px">
            <option value="0">This week</option>
            <option value="1">1 week</option>
            <option value="2">2 weeks</option>
            <option value="4">1 month</option>
            <option value="8">2 months</option>
          </select>

          <div class="timeline" id="timeline">
            <div class="phase">
              <div class="num">1</div>
              <div>
                <h4>Phase 1 — Stabilize (2–4 weeks)</h4>
                <div class="meta">Short practices and assessment: baseline sleep, gentle nutrition cues, 1:1 intake.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase">
              <div class="num">2</div>
              <div>
                <h4>Phase 2 — Build routines (4–6 weeks)</h4>
                <div class="meta">Introduce daily micro-habits and group learning; adapt based on feedback.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase">
              <div class="num">3</div>
              <div>
                <h4>Phase 3 — Maintain & adapt (ongoing)</h4>
                <div class="meta">Shift to self-directed practices with occasional check-ins to sustain gains.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="disclaimer">Note: These phases are a planning tool. They do not substitute for clinical evaluation. If you have a medical concern, consult a qualified clinician in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <small class="meta">Estimated start: <span id="est-start">this week</span>. Recommended first step: <strong id="est-step">20-minute intake</strong>.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel">
          <h4>Contact & quick consult</h4>
          <p class="meta">Share a few details and we’ll reply with a thoughtful next step and scheduling options.</p>

          <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm">
            <input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
            <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />
            <input name="email" placeholder="Email" required />
            <select name="interest" id="interestSelect">
              <option value="short">Short consult (20–30 min)</option>
              <option value="deep">Initial visit (50–60 min)</option>
              <option value="group">Group intro session</option>
            </select>
            <textarea name="notes" placeholder="Brief note: what brought you here today?"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button type="submit" id="sendBtn" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">We respond within 48 hours.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="meta" style="margin-top:8px">By submitting you agree to non-emergency email contact. Not a replacement for urgent medical care.</div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4>Visit details</h4>
          <p class="meta">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
          <p class="meta">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          <p class="meta">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div class="panel" style="flex:1">
        <h4>How Mood-to-Method works</h4>
        <p class="meta">The selector maps a present state to a concise pathway: an immediate coping suggestion, a short session type, and an invite to a recommended first meeting. This is educational guidance to help you take a calm next step.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel" style="width:320px">
        <h4>Privacy note</h4>
        <p class="meta">Messages are held with care. If you need urgent help, contact local emergency services. We do not provide crisis support via this form.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="wrap">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong></div>
      <div class="meta">Built for respectful, practical guidance. Read our full terms and privacy on the site.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    (function(){
      const moods = {
        overwhelmed: {title: 'Short soothe + structure', desc: 'A focused 20-minute session to surface immediate stressors and set two tiny stabilizers (sleep cue, 1 anchoring routine).', cta:'Book a short soothe', href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=short'},
        drained: {title: 'Energy reboot', desc: 'Thirty minutes to review nutrition patterns, naps/rest, and a gentle activity plan to rebuild steady energy.', cta:'Request an energy consult', href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=energy'},
        restless: {title: 'Calm practices', desc: 'Tools to redirect restless energy: evening wind-down plan, breath practices, anchor micro-habits for sleep onset.', cta:'Try a calm consult', href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=calm'},
        stuck: {title: 'Clarity session', desc: 'A focused assessment to identify friction points and a three-step micro-plan to regain momentum.', cta:'Schedule clarity time', href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=clarity'},
        curious: {title: 'Explore options', desc: 'A brief orientation to our pathway options and recommended next steps, including group learning opportunities.', cta:'Explore the pathway', href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?type=explore'}
      };

      // mood buttons
      const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.mood-buttons button');
      const recTitle = document.getElementById('rec-title');
      const recDesc = document.getElementById('rec-desc');
      const cta = document.getElementById('primary-cta');
      const sendBtn = document.getElementById('sendBtn');

      function setMood(key){
        btns.forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.mood===key));
        const d = moods[key];
        recTitle.textContent = d.title;
        recDesc.textContent = d.desc;
        cta.textContent = d.cta;
        cta.href = d.href;
        sendBtn.textContent = d.cta;
        // subtle theme change
        document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--accent', key==='drained'?'#b36a6a': key==='restless'? '#7aa3b5':'#6a9b6a');
      }

      btns.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click', ()=>setMood(b.dataset.mood)));

      // default pick
      setMood('curious');

      // timeline estimator
      const startWeeks = document.getElementById('startWeeks');
      const estStart = document.getElementById('est-start');
      const estStep = document.getElementById('est-step');

      function updateTimeline(){
        const w = parseInt(startWeeks.value,10);
        if(w===0) estStart.textContent = 'this week';
        else if(w===1) estStart.textContent = 'in 1 week';
        else if(w===2) estStart.textContent = 'in 2 weeks';
        else if(w===4) estStart.textContent = 'in ~1 month';
        else estStart.textContent = 'in ~2 months';

        // pick a first step suggestion based on selected start + current mood selection (find active)
        const active = Array.from(btns).find(b=>b.classList.contains('active'))?.dataset.mood || 'curious';
        const map = {overwhelmed:'20-minute intake', drained:'30-minute energy review', restless:'20-minute calm session', stuck:'50-minute clarity visit', curious:'intro overview'};
        estStep.textContent = map[active] || 'intro overview';
      }

      startWeeks.addEventListener('change', updateTimeline);
      updateTimeline();

      // form submission (no backend): just mock and show simple message
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const name = form.name.value || 'there';
        const interest = form.interest.value;
        alert('Thanks, '+name+". We'll reply about your " + interest + ' request soon.');
        form.reset();
      });

      // small accessibility: allow keyboard for mood buttons
      btns.forEach(b=>{ b.tabIndex=0; b.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Enter' || e.key===' ') { e.preventDefault(); b.click(); } }) });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk: contact page for holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T19-49-39-951Z-024\n\nFiles included in this chunk:\n- contact.html  (contact page with interactive features)\n- README.md     (this file)\n\nPurpose:\nThis chunk provides the contact / connect page for the holistic medicine site. It includes two daring features implemented in local JS and HTML: the Mood-to-Method selector and a three-phase Timeline planner. The page is self-contained: CSS, SVG background (inline), and JS are embedded.\n\nPlaceholders that must be replaced by the hosting system or templating engine:\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\n- {{TAGLINE}} (not used on this page but present globally)\n- {{PHONE}}\n- {{EMAIL}}\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\n- {{CITY}}\n- {{STATE}}\n\nInteractive features:\n1) Mood-to-Method selector\n   - Buttons represent current state (Overwhelmed, Drained, Restless, Stuck, Curious).\n   - Selecting a mood updates the recommendation text, CTA label, CTA href, and subtle color accent.\n   - The CTA href includes a query param hint (e.g. ?type=clarity) for downstream handling.\n   - The form submit button mirrors the selected CTA label.\n\n2) Timeline planner (three-phase roadmap)\n   - Shows Phase 1 (Stabilize), Phase 2 (Build routines), Phase 3 (Maintain & adapt).\n   - A dropdown lets the user pick an intended start (this week, 1 week, 2 weeks, etc.).\n   - The estimated start label and suggested first step update based on the selected start and active mood.\n   - Clear disclaimers are included: educational tool only, not medical advice; directs to consult clinicians for medical concerns.\n\nDesign notes:\n- Unique inline SVG pattern is provided in the HTML for visual texture; no external images or fonts are loaded.\n- Navigation uses a different label set: Home, Offerings, Conditions, Method, Investment, Team, Sessions, Connect.\n- CTA phrasing is purposefully varied per mood and does not reuse reserved headline tokens.\n- Tone maintains educational, supportive framing; no guarantees or cures are stated.\n\nHow to test locally:\n1) Save contact.html to a local folder.\n2) Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari).\n3) Interact with the mood buttons; observe the recommendation area and CTA updating.\n4) Change the "Start in (weeks)" dropdown to see the timeline estimator update.\n5) Submit the contact form (it's a client-side mock; an alert confirms submission).\n\nAccessibility & small behaviors:\n- Mood buttons are keyboard operable (Enter/Space).\n- Recommendation area uses aria-live for polite updates.\n\nNotes for integration:\n- Replace placeholders with real values from your backend or static build process.\n- The CTA hrefs are simple query hints; adjust to match the booking flow ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}).\n- If you need the separate assets/img/pattern.svg file, extract the inline SVG and save it, then update the HTML to reference it.\n\nChangelog for this chunk:\n- Initial build of contact page with Mood-to-Method and Timeline planner features.\n"} 
BUNDLE_END
